{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-23003","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23003-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23003-0","text":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23003-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23003-1","text":"「记住，和那些怪物的战争，是不能靠撤退打赢的。」\n「我们的身后就是贝洛伯格，我们就是最后一道钢铁防线，……」\n「只有我们，绝不能退！」\n\n她抬起头，前方是寒天，是冻土，是一望无际的风雪。\n一切如常。\n唯独那个她一直注视着的背影，不在了。","speaker":""}]}
